  "instructions": [
    "Heat grapeseed oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and ginger and stir-fry until onion is translucent.",
    "Add pork belly and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add chili flakes and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add noodles, kombu, soy sauce, salt, and pepper. Cook for 2-3 minutes or until noodles are cooked through.",
    "Add water and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low and simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in heavy cream, if using.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning with light brown soft sugar.",
    "Sprinkle with green onions and sesame seeds.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
